{"unit_id":"YLifeOnlyOnce__dsh-dynamic-island#caveat-1","repo":"YLifeOnlyOnce/dsh-dynamic-island","commit":"d92f9bc83d20949b5f1beec1fd0051f9386a8b63","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Dynamic Island 使用前须知：插件模式下审批交由原生输入栏处理，重试和继续动作尚未接入真实会话调用；岛上的对应操作目前不会执行重试或继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/live-bridge.js:67-68","src/client/live-bridge.js:124-132"]}
